# Every .env file at every depth, not only the root (code review finding 28).
# The frontend stage copies frontend/ whole and Vite inlines VITE_* values from
# a .env.local there into the public bundle. CI plants one and proves it does
# not reach the build context (ci.yml, "no .env file reaches the build").
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
